{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10392","headline":"观李九少府翥树宓子贱神祠碑 · 高适","name":"观李九少府翥树宓子贱神祠碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾友吏兹邑，亦尝怀宓公。\n安知梦寐间，忽与精灵通。\n一见兴永叹，再来激深衷。\n宾从何逶迤，二十四老翁。\n於焉建层碑，突兀长林东。\n作者无愧色，行人感遗风。\n坐令高岸尽，独对秋山空。\n片石勿谓轻，斯言固难穷。\n龙盘色丝外，鹊顾偃波中。\n形胜驻羣目，坚贞指苍穹。\n我非王仲宣，去矣徒发蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10392.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10392","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}